# SIM-02 checkpoint 08: fixed-volume PPPM equilibrium bridge.
# Run from the repository root. This file advances 1,520,000 steps.

units           real
dimension       3
boundary        p p p
atom_style      full

read_data       simulations/SIM-02/lammps/data.spce-4500.ness-ewald
Reading data file ...
  orthogonal box = (-18.176715 -18.176715 -54.530289) to (18.176715 18.176715 54.530289)
  1 by 1 by 4 MPI processor grid
  reading atoms ...
  13500 atoms
  reading velocities ...
  13500 velocities
  scanning bonds ...
  2 = max bonds/atom
  scanning angles ...
  1 = max angles/atom
  orthogonal box = (-18.176715 -18.176715 -54.530289) to (18.176715 18.176715 54.530289)
  1 by 1 by 4 MPI processor grid
  reading bonds ...
  9000 bonds
  reading angles ...
  4500 angles
Finding 1-2 1-3 1-4 neighbors ...
